flowchart LR
  app[Customer application] --> edge[Public API edge]
  user[Customer/operator] --> edge
  edge --> control[Control plane]
  app --> submit[SMTP submission]
  submit --> queue[Durable queue]
  queue --> delivery[Outbound delivery]
  delivery <-->|SMTP| mx[Remote MX servers]
  control --> db[(PostgreSQL)]
  queue --> db
  delivery --> events[(Durable events)]
  control --> events
  events --> consumers[Analytics, webhooks, audit]
